{title: The Battle Belongs to the Lord}
{artist: Jamie Owens-Collins}
{key: Em}

{comment: Verse}
In [Em]heavenly armor we’ll [D/E]enter the [Em]land,
The [C]battle [D]belongs to the [Em]Lord    [D/E]
No [Em]weapon that’s fashion’d [D/E]against us [Em]will stand,
The [C]battle [D/E]belongs to [Em]the Lord

{comment: Chorus}
